        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added support data for <code class=\"notranslate\">display-p3-linear</code> color space</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Tested using <a href=\"https://codepen.io/CodeRedDigital/pen/wBGJQgP?editors=0100\" rel=\"nofollow\">this codepen</a></li>\n<li>Works in the following browsers:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Beta 146</li>\n<li>Firefox Developer Edition 146</li>\n<li>Firefox Nightly 147</li>\n<li>Chrome Canary 144</li>\n<li>Edge 144</li>\n<li>Safari Technical Preview 232</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Does not work in the following browsers:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox 145</li>\n<li>Chrome Beta 143</li>\n<li>Edge Beta 143</li>\n<li>Safari 26.1</li>\n<li>Opera 124</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42003\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42003/hovercard\">Content PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42004\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42004/hovercard\">Firefox release PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1025\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/data/pull/1025/hovercard\">Data PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
